[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "国全土に及んだ水不足の件について……\n無事、解決の目処が立ちました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Regarding the water shortage that affected our entire nation... I'm pleased to announce we've found a solution."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、もうダメかと思っていた！\n我々の祈りが星々に届いたんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, thank goodness! We thought we were done for! Our prayers to the stars have been answered!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizen A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "星の神様の導きに感謝を！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Praise be to the Star God's guidance!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizen B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "解決に導いたのは、神聖国なんでも屋のシトリン。\n前に来なさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The solution was brought to us by Citrine, Nova's handyperson. Step forward."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（結局、アタシは師匠の言う通りにした。\n\u3000それ以上、上手い方法が思いつかなかったから）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(In the end, I did as Master suggested. I couldn't think of a better way.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（錬金術と引き離される可能性があるなら、\n\u3000こうするしかなかった。それは分かってる）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(If there was a chance I'd lose my alchemy... This was the only choice. I know that.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（でも……！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But still...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "此度の活躍、見事でした。\nあなたに星の導きがあらんことを",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your achievements are commendable. May the stars continue to guide your path."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとうー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizen A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この国の英雄だわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A true hero of our nation!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizen B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（もし、本当なら……この歓声を受けていたのは、\n\u3000アタシのはずだったのに、なんでこうなるの……？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(If things were different... those cheers would have been for me. Why did it have to turn out like this...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sister..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh*..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様。お疲れさま",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina. You did well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……私は、全部見てたから。\n姉様がみんなのために頑張ったこと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I saw everything. How hard you worked for everyone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は、姉様こそがこの国の英雄だって、知ってるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To me, you're the real hero of Nova."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップ……うう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp... *sniff*..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐすっ……そんな風に言われたら泣いちゃう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sob*... When you say things like that, I can't help but cry..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。もう泣いてる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. You're already crying."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うっ……うっ……しかも、家に払われた\n報酬のお金、ウチの両親、喜んで寄付しちゃったし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sniff*... *sniff*... And to make matters worse, our parents donated all the reward money..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おいたわしや……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You poor thing..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（――その翌日、アタシは師匠に呼ばれて\n\u3000アトリエを訪れた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The next day, Master August called me to visit the atelier.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "師匠、なんですか話って",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Master, what did you want to discuss?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ああした結末になってしまったことを詫びよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I must apologize for how things turned out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいですよ、もう。\n全部アタシのためだって分かってますから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's fine, really. I know you did it all for my sake."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "結果はああなってしまったが、よく問題解決に導いた。\nお前の錬金術の腕は確かなようだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though the outcome wasn't ideal, you handled the crisis well. Your alchemical skills are undeniable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よって、弟子は卒業とする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Therefore, I'm graduating you as my apprentice."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ、卒業！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What? Graduating!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これからは一人前の錬金術士として、\n自己研鑽に励んでいけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "From now on, continue your studies as a full-fledged alchemist in your own right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、アタシが一人前の錬金術士に！？\nやったあ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I'm a real alchemist now!? Yaaay!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このアトリエも、お前に託すことにしよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm also entrusting this atelier to you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは嬉しいけど……\nまるで師匠がいなくなっちゃうみたいな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That makes me happy, but... It sounds like you're leaving..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その通りだ。しばらくしたら、私はこの国を出る。\n島の外で、やるべきことができたのでな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. Soon, I will leave Nova. Something requires my attention beyond these islands."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "島を出るまでの間に、教えるべきことは\nすべて教え終えてから行く、そこは案ずるな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry. Before I depart, I'll make sure to teach you everything you need to know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また戻って来ますよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You'll come back though, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そっか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "師匠。錬金術を教えてくださり、ありがとうございます\n",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Master. Thank you for teaching me alchemy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "残りの知識も伝えよう、早速はじめるぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's begin passing on the remaining knowledge right away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "師匠は、こんな時までずっと冷静なんですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're so calm even at a time like this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これでも感慨にふけっているぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm actually quite sentimental right now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アウグスト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "August"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えー本当ですかぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ehhh? Really?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]